/home/runner/work/_actions/igor-makarov/shurik/v2/README.md:17:**Status:** reusable TypeScript CLI and action. The v2 input and swarm paths have native scripted-worker integration coverage; the earlier v1 consumer demo supplies the retained live DeepSeek evidence. The agent runs directly on the Actions runner with its job credentials. See [architecture](ARCHITECTURE.md), [verification evidence](VERIFICATION.md), and the [consumer demo](https://github.com/igor-makarov/shurik-demo).
